  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "天马主奔驰，禄星（化禄或禄存）与天马坐会称禄马交驰，仍须宫位旺吉才吉，弱凶则奔波无益。武曲旺宫坐命（身）会禄马利于向外，不必远赴异乡；大限十年亦须兼看先天命宫。四马之地须有星曜才显动性，天府巳命较酉活泼，七杀寅命较戌冲劲强，均属作者举例及授课观点。",
  "summary_en": "Heavenly Horse signifies movement. Lu Ma Jiao Chi combines Horse with a salary influence, either Prosperity Transformation or Salary Star; it is favorable only when the occupied palace is strong and favorable. Military Melody in a strong Life or Body placement meeting salary and Horse favors outward activity, not necessarily relocation abroad. The same reasoning applies during a ten-year Grand Cycle while retaining the natal Life Palace assessment. Four Horse locations intensify the activity of occupying stars: Heavenly Treasury at Si is more lively than at You, and Seven Killings at Yin more forceful than at Xu. These comparisons are qualified teaching examples, not reconstructed charts.",
